# Build targets

The public PWA and Windows desktop app compile from the **same frontend source** with separate Vite modes.

| Script | Mode | Output | PWA service worker |
|--------|------|--------|--------------------|
| `npm run build` | production | `dist/` | Yes (existing Pages deploy) |
| `npm run build:web` | web | `dist-web/` | Yes |
| `npm run build:desktop` | desktop | `dist-desktop/` | **No** |

## Rules

- The Windows/desktop build must **not** register the PWA service worker
- Do not point the production Windows app at the PWA `dist/` artifact
- After shared frontend changes, keep both web and desktop builds green
- Prefer extending `js/platform/` over forking Vite config per feature
